  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Summer Health Campaign for Better Patient Outcomes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Join Human Health Project (HHP) in helping people to increase their health literacy, improving their health outcomes and decreasing their chances of medical errors and deaths. Health Literacy includes teaching patients their Patient Rights, How to Stand up for Themselves and Be Heard, How to Research Online as a Patient and Where to Get Help Where they Live. HHP does this through in person and online Patient Advocacy workshops and follow up support including patient education courses and events.</narrative>
  </description>
